              ":answer/value": "\\frac{4 \\left(2 e^{2 t} + \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)}\\right) \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)}}{16 e^{4 t} \\sin^{4}{\\left(5 t \\right)} + 1}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "9bd0927c-ffd5-58e4-aab5-b94afdaad804",
