              ":answer/value": "- \\frac{8 \\left(- \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)} + 5 \\cos{\\left(5 t \\right)}\\right) e^{2 t} \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)}}{16 e^{4 t} \\sin^{4}{\\left(5 t \\right)} + 1}"
